OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry for most
OL,6,Fovernight, although showers on
OL,7,Fsouthern coastal fringes may move
OL,8,Fslightly inland for Kent and Sussex.
OL,9,FLarge areas of dense fog forming again
OL,10,Fthis evening, along with some frost.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FAreas of dense fog will be
OL,13,Fslow to clear on Monday, but sunny
OL,14,Fspells developing. Showers in Kent and
OL,15,FSussex soon fading. Feeling cool,
OL,16,Fespecially where fog lingers. Breezy
OL,17,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
