OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,6,Fstart Tuesday, rain soon arriving from
OL,7,Fthe southwest. Wednesday a wet start
OL,8,Fbefore turning drier later. Perhaps
OL,9,Frather cloudy on Thursday. Breezy at
OL,10,Ftimes. Temperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
